{"quest_id": 6562, "name": "混戦の毒蛇退治", "description": "毒を持った大蛇が出現したとの報を受け、\n現地に向かった王子一行。しかし折悪くも\nオークの戦士たちと鉢合わせてしまう。\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "ゴールドラッシュ21(2018)", "event_category": "Reproduce", "mission_id": 300204, "map_no": 3456, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 9, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 166, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2102224, "race_id": 8, "change_to": 1, "change_condition": 3, "master_id": 366, "global_id": 365, "phases": [{"hp": 4000, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 450, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 126, "move_speed": 1200.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2102240, "race_id": 8, "master_id": 367, "global_id": 366, "condition": 3}]}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 6500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 120, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_range": 150, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 177, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2115536, "special_effect_id": 61, "missile_id": 297, "missile": {"speed": 4.0, "splash": 80}, "master_id": 31220, "global_id": 4839, "ranged": true}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 22, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1200, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 80, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 221, "move_speed": 1000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2106320, "race_id": 8, "change_to": 4, "change_condition": 3, "master_id": 800, "global_id": 799, "phases": [{"hp": 1200, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 130, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 141, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2106336, "race_id": 8, "master_id": 801, "global_id": 800, "condition": 3}], "spawn_sec": 9}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "巨大な毒蛇が現れたというのは、\nこの辺りでしょうか……？", "face": "l91883c939536"}, {"name": "ベラ", "text": "くんくん、間違いないぞ！\n蛇の気配がこっちからする！", "face": "u16"}, {"name": "オーク", "text": "――このっ、くねくねしおって！", "face": "lc89684e43ae1"}, {"name": "チグリ", "text": "んっ、向こうから戦っている音が……って！\nオークの連中じゃないかっ！", "face": "u310"}, {"name": "オーク", "text": "腕を磨くためと毒蛇退治に来てみたが、\nやはり蛇や獣の類よりも、\n腕の立つ戦士と戦いたいものだ……っ！", "face": "lc89684e43ae1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "どうやら、毒蛇と戦っているようですね。", "face": "l91883c939536"}, {"name": "オーク", "text": "そう、例えば王子こそ我らの相手に相応しい。\n今この場にあの男がいれば、\n即座に戦いを挑むのだが……。", "face": "lc89684e43ae1"}, {"name": "オーク", "text": "いや待て、この気配、この覇気。\n間違いない、王子が近くにいるぞ！", "face": "lc89684e43ae1"}, {"name": "チグリ", "text": "まるで獣みたいに鼻がきく連中だな……。", "face": "u310"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "この状況ではオークと毒蛇、\n両方を相手取らなくてはいけませんね……。", "face": "l91883c939536"}, {"name": "ベラ", "text": "王子、毒蛇は毒を飛ばしてくるぞ。\n当たったらその周囲にも毒がばら撒かれるんだ。", "face": "u16"}, {"name": "チグリ", "text": "毒液に触れると普段以上の痛手を受けるし、\n盾や防具で防ぐのも効果的じゃない。\n毒蛇には十分に気をつけて！", "face": "u310"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "オーク", "text": "実に素晴らしい戦いだったぞ、王子。\nやはり強者との激突は良いものだ……。", "face": "lc89684e43ae1"}, {"name": "オーク", "text": "しかし、こうなると毒蛇が邪魔だったな……。\n次は戦士同士、横槍の入らぬ戦いをしたいものだ。", "face": "lc89684e43ae1"}, {"name": "チグリ", "text": "オーク達、ボロボロなのに何だか嬉しそうだな。", "face": "u310"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "何とかオークも毒蛇も、\n退けることが出来ましたね……。", "face": "l91883c939536"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "しかしジャングルにこんな毒蛇がいたなんて、\n今後は気をつけなければなりませんね。", "face": "l91883c939536"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map3456", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 206, "y": 532}, {"k": "m", "x": 446, "y": 424, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 726, "y": 470, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 191, "y": 308, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 683, "y": 144, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 820, "y": 486, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 408, "y": 272, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 783, "y": 145, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 520, "y": 234, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 581, "y": 165, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 642, "y": 424, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 303, "y": 294, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 316, "y": 443, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 602, "y": 350, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 382, "y": 179, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 291, "y": 135, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 182, "y": 131, "id": 215}, {"k": "r", "x": 362, "y": 481, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 551, "y": 308, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 764, "y": 192, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 704, "y": 200, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 583, "y": 437, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 694, "y": 502, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 188, "y": 349, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 205, "y": 216, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 284, "y": 183, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 521, "y": 111, "id": 309}]}, "active": true}